OL,3,GNEWSAHospital neglect contributed to
OL,4,Ababy death - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeglect by hospital staff contributed
OL,7,Fto the death of a five-month-old girl
OL,8,Ffrom meningitis after a series of
OL,9,Fmissed opportunities to save or prolong
OL,10,Fher life, an inquest jury has found.
OL,12,FEsta High died at Leeds General
OL,13,FInfirmary in November 2023, days after
OL,14,Fshe was taken into the emergency
OL,15,Fdepartment with a high temperature and
OL,16,Fvomiting.
