OL,3,GNEWSAHospital neglect contributed to
OL,4,Ababy death - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer parents claimed doctors missed
OL,7,Fvital chances to test for a bacterial
OL,8,Finfection and start antibiotic
OL,9,Ftreatment, with her mother saying their
OL,10,Fconcerns were ignored until it was too
OL,11,Flate.
OL,13,FA jury concluded on Tuesday that Esta
OL,14,F"died of natural causes contributed to
OL,15,Fby neglect" and different care would
OL,16,Fprobably have "saved or prolonged her
OL,17,Flife".
